Package: agent-radar
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Agent-Radar Contributors <team@agent-radar.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/agent-radar/agent-radar
Description: Ultra-lightweight terminal HUD for AI coding agents
 Agent-Radar is an ultra-lightweight, zero-privilege workspace activity HUD
 designed to monitor, categorize, and visually stream AI CLI agent behavior
 (Claude Code, Aider, Antigravity, Cursor) directly inside a Linux terminal.
